  "claim": "The Greatest Game Ever Played was the movie based on a book. The film in which  Wallace Shawn played Terence Stamp was not.",
  "evidencia": "Page: The Haunted Mansion (film). Sentence: The Haunted Mansion is a 2003 American fantasy comedy horror film based on the Disney theme park attraction of the same name.\nPage: The Greatest Game Ever Played. Sentence: The film's screenplay was adapted by Mark Frost from his book, \"The Greatest Game Ever Played: Harry Vardon, Francis Ouimet, and the Birth of Modern Golf\".\nPage: Wallace Shawn. Sentence: His film roles have included those of Wally Shawn in the Louis Malle-directed comedy-drama \"My Dinner with Andre\" (1981), Vizzini in \"The Princess Bride\" (1987), Ezra in \"The Haunted Mansion\", providing the voice of Rex in the \"Toy Story\" franchise, providing the voice of Gilbert Huph in \"The Incredibles\" (2004), and providing the voice of Calico in \"\" (2010).",
